WEBVTT

00:09:29.267 --> 00:09:31.415
merret nje qelize

00:09:31.415 --> 00:09:33.701
qe eshte nje qelize qe ndryshon

00:09:33.701 --> 00:09:36.385
qe duket si nje skiator ne maje te malit,

00:09:36.385 --> 00:09:40.202
dhe keta dy skiatore behen qeliza trungu

00:09:40.202 --> 00:09:41.984
4,8,16

00:09:41.984 --> 00:09:43.652
dhe behen aq shume sa qe

00:09:43.652 --> 00:09:45.452
pas 16 percarjeve

00:09:45.452 --> 00:09:47.954
ato qeliza duhet te ndryshojne.

00:09:47.954 --> 00:09:49.387
Keshtu, ata shkojne poshte nje ane te malit,

00:09:49.387 --> 00:09:50.620
ato shkojne poshte ne nje ane tjeter.

00:09:50.620 --> 00:09:52.154
Derisa ata jane aty

00:09:52.154 --> 00:09:54.404
keto behen eshtra,

00:09:54.404 --> 00:09:57.336
pastaj ata zgjedhin nje rruge tjeter dhe keto behen pllakeza

00:09:57.336 --> 00:09:59.453
keto behen makrofage

00:09:59.453 --> 00:10:00.720
dhe keto behen qeliza T me pas.